Package: kubeos-pause-image
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, containerd.io
Description: the pod sandbox (pause) image, shipped offline
 Every container KubeOS runs - including yours - starts inside the pause image, and
 a node has no registry after installation. This package carries that image as an OCI
 archive so the kubelet never has to pull it, and so the tag can move with kubeadm
 through apt instead of through a new ISO.
 .
 The archive is imported into containerd's k8s.io namespace by the build hook (offline
 builds) or by this package's postinst when containerd is already running.
